  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: '<size=18>- 6 or more Bonus symbols triggers

      the Lock & Merge ReSpin Bonus'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_11
    value: '<size=20>- 3 or more Scatters trigers

      Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12_0
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>15</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>10</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>5</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12_1
    value: "<size=20>- 3 or more Scatters triggers \n\LFree Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_LOYAL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_01
    value: <style=title><size=30>SPECIAL WILD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01
    value: "<size=14>\n- Special Wild substitutes for all symbols.\n- 3 Special Wilds
      triggers the Special\n  Juicy Reward Bonus.\n- Special Wilds appear on reels
      2, 3\n  and 4 only.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02
    value: "<size=14>\n- Fruit Wilds substitute for all symbols\n  except Fruit Wilds
      of other colors.\n- 3 identical Fruit Wilds triggers the\n  Juicy Reward Bonus.
      \n- Fruit Wilds appear on reels 2, 3 and 4 only."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03
    value: '<size=14>

      - Fruit Reward symbols only appear on the Fruit Reels.


      - Fruit Reward symbols award Coin Values or Free Games through the Juicy Reward
      Bonus.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02
    value: <style=title><size=30>FRUIT WILDS</size></style>
  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_03
    value: <style=title><size=30>FRUIT REWARDS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=30>FRUIT REEL FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <style=title><size=30>JUICY REWARDS BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <style=title><size=30>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: '<style=title><size=30>FREE GAMES: SELECTED FRUIT FEATURE</size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: <style=title><size=30>EXTRA BET</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=24>\n- There is a 5x5 Fruit Reel set above Base Reels\n  where only
      Fruit Reward symbols appear.\n\n- During Base Games, symbols on Fruit Reels
      come\n  down by 1 row every 5 spins.\n\n- During Free Games, symbols on the
      Fruit Reels\n  come down by 1 row on every spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=24>\n- 3 identical Fruit Wilds triggers the Juicy Reward\n  Bonus.\n\n-
      Special Wild symbol substitutes for any of the\n  Fruit Wilds.\n\n- When Juicy
      Reward Bonus is triggered, player wins\n  the sum of prizes on Fruit Reward
      symbols of the\n  same Fruit kind as the triggering Fruit Wilds\n\n    - E.g.
      2 Watermelon Wilds and one Special\n      Wild triggers the Watermelon Juicy
      Reward\n      Bonus and awards the sum of prizes on all\n      Watermelon Fruit
      Reward symbols on the\n      Fruit Reels.\n    \n   - E.g. 3 Special Wilds awards
      the sum of prizes\n     on all Fruit Reward symbols on the Fruit Reels.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=24>\n- Fruit Reward symbols have two types of prizes\n  : Coin Values
      or Free Games.\n\n    - Each Fruit Reward symbol with\n      \u201CFree Games\u201D
      awards 5 free spins. \n\n- Once total win is evaluated, awarded\n  Fruit Reward
      symbols disappear, and new\n  Fruit Reward symbols cascade down to fill the\n
      \ empty spots.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=24>\n- Free Games is only triggered through the Juicy\n  Reward
      Bonus.\n\n- During Free Games, \"Add Spin(s)\" Fruit Reward\n  symbols appear
      instead of \"Free Games\"\n  Fruit Reward symbols.\n\n- \"Add Spin(s)\" Fruit
      Reward symbols awards\n  additional free spins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=24>\n- Selected Fruit Feature is triggered before every\n  spin
      during Free Games.\n\n- One of the 3 Fruits is randomly selected\n  : Watermelon,
      Pineapple or Kiwi. \n\n- Chosen Fruit Wild replaces all Wilds, other than\n
      \ Special Wilds, on Base Reels for that spin.\n\n- Replaced Fruit Wilds are
      reset before the next\n  Free Spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: "<size=24>\n- 50% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to activate\n  the
      Juicy Reward Bonus."
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Juicy Reward
